You didn't actually tame the new dog, just made him non-hostile (I
forget the actual game term).  The new dog wouldn't attack you, but he
wasn't your pet either.  However, your dog couldn't care whether
something is non-hostile or hostile, it will attack it anyway (if it is
a lower level).  What you need to do is toss food at the new dog until
it is 'tame' (which you can tell by looking at it with '/').  Then your
dogs will cooperate.

Getting lots and lots of pets is not always good, as it can be a real
pain to go down stairs when you've got lots.

